  "description": "Voodoo\n\nCanzo E-Bike: Unleash Your Trail Potential\n\nThe Canzo E-Bike combines cutting-edge technology with a trail-ready design, taking your rides to the next level. Inspired by the original Voodoo Canzo, this full-suspension electric bike features a lightweight Shimano EP6 motor that delivers an impressive 85Nm of torque, providing extra support and power to help you discover new trails or squeeze in more laps at the trail center.\n\nWith three customizable assistance modes—Eco, Trail, and Boost—the Shimano EP6 system lets you easily adjust the power to match your riding style and the terrain. The modern trail geometry, featuring a 65° head angle, ensures control and confidence on steep descents while maintaining agility on flatter trails. The Shimano CUES 1x10 drivetrain, with its wide-range 11-48 tooth cassette, offers smooth and reliable shifting for any climb, and the Shimano MT200 hydraulic brakes provide powerful, confidence-boosting stopping power.\n\nOutfitted with a RockShox Psylo Silver R fork (140mm travel) and a RockShox Deluxe Select rear shock, the Canzo E-Bike is ready to conquer any trail right out of the box. A WTB Volt saddle sits on a dropper post, allowing you to quickly adjust the seat height, and the Maxxis Forekaster tires offer versatile grip and performance in various weather conditions. Whether you're hitting rugged trails or exploring scenic routes, the Canzo E-Bike is your perfect companion for adventure. Discover new places. Do more laps. And have more fun on the trails.\n\nThe NEW Canzo Electric Bike is perfect for anyone looking to explore trails with ease and excitement. Whether you're new to cycling or want a bike that makes riding more fun, this full-suspension electric mountain bike is designed to help you enjoy every adventure. It's simple, reliable, and ready to take you wherever you want to go!",
